[node name="Details" type="Node2D" parent="."]

[node name="SplitCrate" type="Area2D" parent="Details"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(-150, 130)
collision_layer = 16
collision_mask = 1
script = ExtResource("9_story_item")
interaction_name = "Look in the Split Crate"
flag_to_set = ""
discovery_text = "[b]A split crate[/b]

Stencilled on the side: [i]WOOL. FERRISFORD. FOR WAREHOUSE SEVEN.[/i] The slats have sprung where a careless hoist dropped it, and between them, packed in straw, is not wool but the dark wrapped shape of a sword hilt. Then another. The straw smells of a forge.

Someone has already hammered a fresh board across the worst of the split."
reexamine_text = "Swords packed as wool, bound for Warehouse Seven."

[node name="CollisionShape2D" type="CollisionShape2D" parent="Details/SplitCrate"]
shape = SubResource("Rect_100x60")

[node name="InteractionPrompt" type="Label" parent="Details/SplitCrate"]
