theme_override_constants/outline_size = 3
theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 14
text = "[E] Look in the Split Crate"
horizontal_alignment = 1

[node name="BargeRegister" type="Area2D" parent="Details"]
z_index = 6
position = Vector2(330, 370)
collision_layer = 16
collision_mask = 1
script = ExtResource("9_story_item")
interaction_name = "Read the Barge Register"
flag_to_set = ""
discovery_text = "[b]The harbour-master's register[/b]

Barges in and out, by name and master. Most arrive by day. A handful each month arrive after curfew from upriver, entered only as \"[i]Guild barge, from Ferrisford, toll paid at the crossing[/i]\" and, beside each, a small carved mark copied from the ferryman's tally: [i]O.[/i]

The harbour-master has never once written down what they carried."
reexamine_text = "Night barges from Ferrisford, each marked 'O.'"

[node name="CollisionShape2D" type="CollisionShape2D" parent="Details/BargeRegister"]
shape = SubResource("Rect_130x50")

[node name="InteractionPrompt" type="Label" parent="Details/BargeRegister"]
